{"speciesId":712,"names":{"fr":"Grelaçon","es":"Bergmite","en":"Bergmite","ja":"カチコール"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"La glace qui couvre son corps bloque les attaques ennemies. Si elle se fissure, il la reconstitue immédiatement en soufflant de l’air glacé."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Envuelve su cuerpo en una capa de hielo que le permite evitar los ataques del enemigo. Si se resquebraja, la recompone con aire gélido."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It blocks opponents’ attacks with the ice that shields its body. It uses cold air to repair any cracks with new ice."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"体を 覆う 氷が 敵の 攻撃を 防ぐ。割られても 冷気で すぐに 氷を 張る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il gèle ses ennemis d’une bourrasque à -100 °C. Il vit en troupeau avec ses congénères, dans les neiges éternelles des hautes montagnes."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Congela a sus enemigos sometiéndolos a un aire gélido de -100 °C. Forman grupos para habitar montañas cubiertas de una nieve sempiterna."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Using air of -150 degrees Fahrenheit, they freeze opponents solid. They live in herds above the snow line on mountains."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"マイナス１００度の 冷気で 敵を 氷漬けにする。万年雪に 覆われた 山で 群れを 作る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"La glace qui couvre son corps bloque les attaques ennemies. Si elle se fissure, il la reconstitue immédiatement en soufflant de l’air glacé."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Envuelve su cuerpo en una capa de hielo que le permite evitar los ataques del enemigo. Si se resquebraja, la recompone con aire gélido."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"It blocks opponents’ attacks with the ice that shields its body. It uses cold air to repair any cracks with new ice."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"体を 覆う 氷が 敵の 攻撃を 防ぐ。割られても 冷気で すぐに 氷を 張る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il gèle ses ennemis d’une bourrasque à -100 °C. Il vit en troupeau avec ses congénères, dans les neiges éternelles des hautes montagnes."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Congela a sus enemigos sometiéndolos a un aire gélido de -100 °C. Forman grupos para habitar montañas cubiertas de una nieve sempiterna."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Using air of -150 degrees Fahrenheit, they freeze opponents solid. They live in herds above the snow line on mountains."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"マイナス１００度の 冷気で 敵を 氷漬けにする。万年雪に 覆われた 山で 群れを 作る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Grâce à son souffle glacé à - 100 °C, il peut geler l’humidité dans l’air et se façonner une carapace de glace."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Congela la humedad del ambiente exhalando vaho a -100 °C para crear una coraza de hielo con la que protege su cuerpo."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"They chill the air around them to −150 degrees Fahrenheit, freezing the water in the air into ice that they use as armor."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"氷点下 １００度の 冷気で 空気中の 水分を 凍らせ 氷の 装甲で 身を 守る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il vit dans les régions les plus froides, agrippé aux Séracrawl. Il gèle ses pattes sur leur dos pour se maintenir en place."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Vive en regiones sumamente frías. Se aferra al lomo de los Avalugg congelando sus propias extremidades."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"This Pokémon lives in areas of frigid cold. It secures itself to the back of an Avalugg by freezing its feet in place."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"極寒の 地域に 生息する。 クレベースの 背中と 自分の 足を 凍りつかせて 固定する。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"Lives on mountains blanketed in perennial snow. It freezes water vapor in the air to make the ice helmet that it dons for defense."}],"varieties":[{"id":712,"moves":[{"name":"tackle","learns":[[15,"level-